    {
      "number": 9,
      "actor": "northern",
      "decision": {
        "kind": "speak",
        "text": "I'll bring the notice board's oldest joke \u2014 the one about the baker who charged extra for 'fresh air' in his loaves. It's short, everyone's heard it, and if I trip over the punchline it just makes it funnier. Good place to start."
