      "decision": {
        "kind": "speak",
        "text": "That's perfect \u2014 the baker's 'fresh air' joke is exactly the kind of shared, imperfect start I was hoping for. Northern, would you be willing to read it first, stumbles and all? And if anyone else has a lullaby or market chant they'd offer for a second round, I'd love to hear it."
      },
      "success": true,
